n>Business Digitization</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] tracking-[0.28em] uppercase px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:#000;color:#4ECDC4"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full" class="lg-btn"></span> For established businesses</span></div><div class="grid grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-10 items-start"><div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7"><h1 class="text-[clamp(34px,6vw,96px)] font-bold leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.035em]" style="font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif;color:#000000"><span class="block overflow-hidden"><span class="block" style="transform:none">Your business runs.</span></span><span class="block overflow-hidden"><span class="block" style="transform:none">Your systems</span></span><span class="block overflow-hidden"><span class="block" style="transform:none">haven&#x27;t <span style="font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, serif" class="italic font-normal">caught up.</span></span></span></h1><p class="mt-6 sm:mt-10 max-w-[640px] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px] md:text-[20px] leading-relaxed" style="color:#1a1a1a;opacity:1;transform:none">We move established businesses off spreadsheets, WhatsApp groups, and tribal knowledge — into CRMs, automation, AI support, and dashboards that compound every quarter.</p><div class="mt-7 sm:mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><a href="{{ url('/strategy-session') }}" style="display:inline-block"><span class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-7 py-4 text-[13px] tracking-wide overflow-hidden text-black" style="background:#4ECDC4;transform:none"><span class="relative z-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2">Book A Digitization Audit<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span class="absolute inset-0 -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out" style="background:#4ECDC4;mix-blend-mode:screen;opacity:0.4"></span></span></a><a href="{{ url('/strategy-session') }}" style="display:inline-block"><span class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-7 py-4 text-[13px] tracking-wide overflow-hidden border" style="border-color:#000000;color:#000000;transform:none"><span class="relative z-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2">See Our Approach<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></span></a></div></div><div class="hidden lg:block col-span-5 relative h-[480px]"><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[28px] overflow-hidden shadow-[0_40px_80px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><img src="{{ asset('assets/bd-hero-xJxtAxe-.webp') }}" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover" width="1280" height="1280"/></div><div class="absolute -bottom-3 left-2 sm:-bottom-6 sm:-left-6 rounded-2xl bg-white px-4 py-3 sm:px-5 sm:py-4 shadow-[0_20px_50px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)]" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase" style="color:#6b6b6b">Hours saved / wk</div><div class="mt-1 text-[28px] font-bold tabular-nums leading-none" style="color:#000000"><span>0<!-- -->+</span></div></div><div class="absolute -top-3 right-2 sm:-top-6 sm:-right-6 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 sm:px-5 sm:py-4 shadow-[0_20px_50px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)]" style="background:#4ECDC4;color:#000;opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase" style="color:rgba(0,0,0,0.65)">Avg. ROI yr 1</div><div class="mt-1 text-[28px] font-bold tabular-nums leading-none"><span>0<!-- -->%</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white py-20 sm:py-32 border-t" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 sm:px-8 grid grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-12"><div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] tracking-[0.32em] uppercase font-medium" style="color:#000000;opacity:1;transform:none"><span class="h-px w-8 origin-left" style="background:#000000;transform:scaleX(1)"></span>Signs Your Business Needs Digitization</span><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(28px,4.5vw,56px)] font-bold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.025em]" style="color:#000000;font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">If three of these sound familiar, <span style="font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, serif" class="italic font-normal">we need to talk.</span></h2><p class="mt-5 sm:mt-6 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] leading-relaxed max-w-[420px]" style="color:#333333">Most businesses don&#x27;t have a software problem — they have a systems problem. Digitization is what fixes it.</p></div><div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 sm:gap-5"><div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-6 rounded-3xl border p-6 sm:p-7" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.1);background:#ffffff;opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em]" style="color:#6b6b6b">01</div><h3 class="mt-5 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em]" style="color:#000000;font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">Spreadsheets run the business</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:#333333">Critical data lives in five Excel files, three Google Sheets, and one founder&#x27;s head — and they don&#x27;t agree with each other.</p></div><div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-6 rounded-3xl border p-6 sm:p-7" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.1);background:#ffffff;opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em]" style="color:#6b6b6b">02</div><h3 class="mt-5 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em]" style="color:#000000;font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">Staff repeat the same task daily</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:#333333">Quotes, invoices, follow-ups, status updates — copy-pasted by hand because no system connects to the next.</p></div><div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-6 rounded-3xl border p-6 sm:p-7" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.1);background:#ffffff;opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em]" style="color:#6b6b6b">03</div><h3 class="mt-5 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em]" style="color:#000000;font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">Customers wait too long</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:#333333">Replies take hours, requests fall through cracks, and the team spends more time chasing tickets than resolving them.</p></div><div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-6 rounded-3xl border p-6 sm:p-7" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.1);background:#ffffff;opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em]" style="color:#6b6b6b">04</div><h3 class="mt-5 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em]" style="color:#000000;font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">You can&#x27;t answer simple questions fast</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:#333333">How many active customers? What&#x27;s this month&#x27;s gross margin? Which sales rep is underperforming? Nobody knows without a meeting.</p></div><div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-6 rounded-3xl border p-6 sm:p-7" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.1);background:#ffffff;opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em]" style="color:#6b6b6b">05</div><h3 class="mt-5 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em]" style="color:#000000;font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">Hiring is the only way to scale</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:#333333">Every new client means another headcount, because the business has no leverage from systems — only from people.</p></div><div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-6 rounded-3xl border p-6 sm:p-7" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.1);background:#ffffff;opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em]" style="color:#6b6b6b">06</div><h3 class="mt-5 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em]" style="color:#000000;font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">Tools don&#x27;t talk to each other</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:#333333">Accounting, CRM, support, inventory, marketing — five logins, zero integration, weekly reconciliation pain.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 sm:py-32 border-t overflow-hidden" style="background:#4ECDC4;border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.85)"><img src="{{ asset('assets/bd-workflow-BZDdYYDh.webp') }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="1280" height="1280" class="hidden lg:block absolute -right-32 -top-20 w-[55%] pointer-events-none opacity-30 mix-blend-screen" style="mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 40%, transparent 75%);-webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 40%, transparent 75%)"/><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="grid grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-12 items-end mb-10 sm:mb-14"><div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] tracking-[0.32em] uppercase font-medium" style="color:rgba(0,0,0,0.65);opacity:1;transform:none"><span class="h-px w-8" style="background:#000"></span> Problems We Solve</span><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(30px,4.5vw,72px)] font-bold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em] text-black" style="font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif"><span><span class="inline-block align-bottom mr-[0.25em] pb-[0.2em]"><span class="inline-block " style="transform:none">The</span></span><span class="inline-block align-bottom mr-[0.25em] pb-[0.2em]"><span class="inline-block " style="transform:none">five</span></span><span class="inline-block align-bottom mr-[0.25em] pb-[0.2em]"><span class="inline-block " style="transform:none">drags</span></span></span><br/><span><span class="inline-block align-bottom mr-[0.25em] pb-[0.2em]"><span class="inline-block italic font-normal" style="font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, serif;transform:none">on</span></span><span class="inline-block align-bottom mr-[0.25em] pb-[0.2em]"><span class="inline-block italic font-normal" style="font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, serif;transform:none">every</span></span><span class="inline-block align-bottom mr-[0.25em] pb-[0.2em]"><span class="inline-block italic font-normal" style="font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, serif;transform:none">business.</span></span></span></h2></div><p class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-black/70">We don&#x27;t sell software. We diagnose what&#x27;s slowing you down, and we replace it with systems that quietly do the work in the background.</p></div><div class="grid grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 sm:gap-5"><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-4 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 border" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.85);background:transparent;opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-5" style="color:rgba(0,0,0,0.65)">0<!-- -->1</div><h3 class="text-[24px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-black" style="font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">Manual Operations</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-black/70">Quotes, invoices, onboarding, scheduling — anything done by hand becomes the bottleneck the moment volume grows.</p></div><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-4 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 border" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.85);background:transparent;opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-5" style="color:rgba(0,0,0,0.65)">0<!-- -->2</div><h3 class="text-[24px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-black" style="font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">Fragmented Communication</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-black/70">Customer threads scattered across WhatsApp, email, and DMs. Nothing logged, nothing searchable, nothing handed off cleanly.</p></div><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-4 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 border" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.85);background:transparent;opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-5" style="color:rgba(0,0,0,0.65)">0<!-- -->3</div><h3 class="text-[24px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-black" style="font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">Customer Service Bottlenecks</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-black/70">Tickets pile up, SLA targets slip, and your best agents burn out covering for the absence of a real support system.</p></div><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-4 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 border" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.85);background:transparent;opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-5" style="color:rgba(0,0,0,0.65)">0<!-- -->4</div><h3 class="text-[24px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-black" style="font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">Data Silos</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-black/70">Sales, finance, operations, and marketing each own a slice — and no-one owns the full picture of the customer or the business.</p></div><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-4 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 border" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.85);background:transparent;opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-5" style="color:rgba(0,0,0,0.65)">0<!-- -->5</div><h3 class="text-[24px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-black" style="font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">Operational Inefficiencies</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-black/70">Hours lost to status meetings, manual reports, duplicated data entry, and chasing approvals through email chains.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 sm:py-32 border-t overflow-hidden" st